============================================================
8. REPRODUCTIVE STATE MUST REMAIN SEPARATE
============================================================

A module is not automatically a seed.

A useful reproductive-state representation is:


class ReproductiveState:

    VEGETATIVE = "vegetative"

    FEMALE = "female"

    MALE = "male"

    INTERSEX = "intersex"


Do NOT implement sex determination like this:

if nitrate > X:
    sex = "intersex"


That would imply nitrate concentration reliably determines
sexual phenotype, which this mathematical growth model
does not establish.


Instead:

                  VEGETATIVE MODULE
                         |
                         |
              reproductive development
                         |
                  +------+------+
                  |      |      |
                  v      v      v
                MALE   FEMALE  INTERSEX
                  |      |       |
                  +------+-------+
                         |
                  reproductive events
                         |
                         v
                        SEED


============================================================
9. OPTIONAL REPRODUCTIVE MODULE
============================================================

Actual seed production can be represented separately:


def reproductive_seed_model(
    reproductive_sites,
    pollination_probability,
    fertilization_probability,
    maturation_probability
):

    p_seed = clamp01(

        pollination_probability

        * fertilization_probability

        * maturation_probability
    )


    expected_seed_output = (
        reproductive_sites
        * p_seed
    )


    return {

        "mature_seed_probability":
            p_seed,

        "expected_seed_output":
            expected_seed_output
    }


This represents:

REPRODUCTIVE SITE
       |
       v
POLLINATION
       |
       v
FERTILIZATION
       |
       v
EMBRYO DEVELOPMENT
       |
       v
SEED MATURATION
       |
       v
NEW SEED


It is deliberately NOT:

VEGETATIVE MODULE
       |
       v
SEED


