10. "ZERO CIRCLE" STATE REDUCTION
============================================================

The system can be compressed into four Zero-Circle states.


Z0 = SEED


Z1 = ACTIVATED EMBRYO


Z2 = ESTABLISHED VEGETATIVE MODULE


Z3 = RENEWABLE MODULAR POPULATION


Therefore:


Z0
 |
 | germination
 v
Z1
 |
 | establishment
 v
Z2
 |
 | bounded modular proliferation
 v
Z3


Or mathematically:


Z0
   --germination-->
Z1

Z1
   --establishment-->
Z2

Z2
   --bounded cleaving-->
Z3


IMPORTANT:

After Z2, the word "cleaving" means:

    vegetative module generation

NOT:

    repeated seed-coat splitting


