13. NON-FLOWERING "CLEAVING" INTERPRETATION
============================================================

For the non-flowering stage, interpret cleaving as:

MERISTEM ACTIVITY

        +

NODE PRODUCTION

        +

BRANCH PRODUCTION

        +

VEGETATIVE PROPAGATION

        =

MODULAR EXPANSION


Therefore:

NON-FLOWERING PLANT

        ->

VEGETATIVE MODULES

        ->

MORE VEGETATIVE MODULES


NOT:

NON-FLOWERING PLANT

        ->

SEEDS


True seeds remain downstream of reproductive development.


